{"title": "Magical Durability (+2)", "pageid": 28064, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Magical_Durability_(+2)", "categories": ["Passive item features", "Passive features"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div role=\"note\" class=\"hatnote noexcerpt\">Not to be confused with <a href=\"/wiki/Magical_Durability_(%2B1)\" title=\"Magical Durability (+1)\">Magical Durability (+1)</a>        </div>\n\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<p><b>Magical Durability</b> is a passive feature that increases the user's defenses against spells.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Description\"> Description </span></h2>\n<p>The wielder has a +2 bonus to <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e7/Saving_Throw_Icon.png/25px-Saving_Throw_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/e/e7/Saving_Throw_Icon.png 1.5x\"><img alt=\"Saving Throw\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e7/Saving_Throw_Icon.png/25px-Saving_Throw_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/e/e7/Saving_Throw_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Saving_Throw\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Saving Throw\">Saving Throws</a> against spells. \n</p>\n<div style=\"clear: both;\"></div>\n</div> \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"How_to_learn\"> How to learn </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<p>Granted by the weapons:</p><ul style=\"list-style: none;\">\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 6px\"><span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-rare\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Sword_of_the_Emperor\" title=\"Sword of the Emperor\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/6e/Longsword_%2B1_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Longsword_%2B1_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/6/6e/Longsword_%2B1_Unfaded_Icon.png/45px-Longsword_%2B1_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/6/6e/Longsword_%2B1_Unfaded_Icon.png/60px-Longsword_%2B1_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/6/6e/Longsword_%2B1_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Longsword_%2B1_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/6/6e/Longsword_%2B1_Unfaded_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Sword_of_the_Emperor\" title=\"Sword of the Emperor\">Sword of the Emperor</a></span></li>\n</ul>\n<p>Granted by the equipment:</p><ul style=\"list-style: none;\">\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 6px\"><span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-rare\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Flawed_Helldusk_Helmet\" title=\"Flawed Helldusk Helmet\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/4/45/Flawed_Helldusk_Helmet_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Flawed_Helldusk_Helmet_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/4/45/Flawed_Helldusk_Helmet_Unfaded_Icon.png/45px-Flawed_Helldusk_Helmet_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/4/45/Flawed_Helldusk_Helmet_Unfaded_Icon.png/60px-Flawed_Helldusk_Helmet_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/4/45/Flawed_Helldusk_Helmet_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Flawed_Helldusk_Helmet_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/4/45/Flawed_Helldusk_Helmet_Unfaded_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Flawed_Helldusk_Helmet\" title=\"Flawed Helldusk Helmet\">Flawed Helldusk Helmet</a></span></li><li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 6px\"><span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-very-rare\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Helldusk_Helmet\" title=\"Helldusk Helmet\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/4/4d/Helldusk_Helmet_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Helldusk_Helmet_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/4/4d/Helldusk_Helmet_Unfaded_Icon.png/45px-Helldusk_Helmet_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/4/4d/Helldusk_Helmet_Unfaded_Icon.png/60px-Helldusk_Helmet_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/4/4d/Helldusk_Helmet_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Helldusk_Helmet_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/4/4d/Helldusk_Helmet_Unfaded_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Helldusk_Helmet\" title=\"Helldusk Helmet\">Helldusk Helmet</a></span></li>\n</ul>\n</div>    \n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260714201808\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.046 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.052 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 1825/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 18237/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 3328/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 25/200\nExpensive parser function count: 0/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 0/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 40/1000\nLua time usage: 0.018/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 967867/52428800 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   46.072      1 -total\n 98.12%   45.208      1 Template:Passive_feature_page\n 40.54%   18.678      3 Template:Passive_sources/format\n 37.49%   17.272      3 Template:MdRarityItem\n 30.47%   14.037      3 Template:Item_icon\n 28.55%   13.155     